    description: 'Keyboard maps from the WAI-ARIA practices and an axe assertion in every test.',
  },
  {
    id: 'deps',
    icon: <Icon d="M12 3 3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8l-9-5Zm0 0v18M3 8l9 5 9-5" />,
